OL,3,GNEWSACouple who lost baby query        
OL,4,Amaternity unit closure                 
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains details 
OL,7,Fthat some readers may find distressing.
OL,9,FThe mother of a baby girl who was      
OL,10,Fstillborn at 36 weeks believes there is
OL,11,Fa chance her daughter could have been  
OL,12,Fsaved if her local maternity unit had  
OL,13,Fstill been open.                       
OL,15,FLauren Voice and Luke Smyth's daughter 
OL,16,FIsla Mae died after Lauren experienced 
OL,17,Freduced movements in the final weeks of
OL,18,Fher pregnancy.                         
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
