OL,3,GNEWSACouple who lost baby query        
OL,4,Amaternity unit closure                 
OL,6,FThe couple were told she had died in   
OL,7,Fthe womb after making a 55-mile trip to
OL,8,Fthe maternity unit at Exeter following 
OL,9,Fthe temporary closure of north Devon's 
OL,10,FLadywell Unit, which is closest to     
OL,11,Fthem.                                  
